null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/37d4215a/uploads/origins/89766aaa-bf8f-4ee3-aeac-31fea00fccde?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b3518f6e87fa690a038ba6e0f9f2f1b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/37d4215a/uploads/origins/89766aaa-bf8f-4ee3-aeac-31fea00fccde?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ac5031a36bffa6c6f1b04950c93c4856", "src_set": ""}, "body": "汐那さん、おはようございます！（　＾ω＾）・・・\n吸血鬼の子を描いていただきありがとうございました。\n\n今度は私のOCでピークと友達のりゅを描いてください！りゅはピークとは正反対の性格です！\nりゅはピークの正反対です。ピークが内気で不機嫌なのに対して、りゅはとても外向的で友達をいじめるのが大好きです。それから、りゅはピークより背が高くて、緑色が大好きなんだ。\n\nこのポーズで描いてください！ : https://imgur.com/a/2KEMxec\n(左がピーク、右がりゅです)\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\n💔 ピークちゃん https://imgur.com/a/V6kGyrw\n💚 りゅちゃん https://imgur.com/a/Jxfyj64", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@siona0625/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1971667, "client_id": 2107264, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/84791c57/uploads/origins/297a7177-c3fb-4c16-8c56-24fddf8e5770?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e306f4a1f0e05003d03826e4bb7f0ae", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/84791c57/uploads/origins/297a7177-c3fb-4c16-8c56-24fddf8e5770?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=155ef4363a47177edc9b298978391a4a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! Could I get my VTuber drawn however you would like? I would appreciate a transparent version for my vtubing activities as well. I would use it for twitter, youtube, and twitch. Thank you!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/nami_bat/status/1620961727088295936?s=46&t=XdGq1lGik-3MXrnO4cbqJQ", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@siona0625/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1971667, "client_id": 2125284, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8d01a95/uploads/origins/25af5cd7-3c4e-4c4c-8e56-5553e61fb5d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b652af6af96351f6dbe7eec62560c643", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8d01a95/uploads/origins/25af5cd7-3c4e-4c4c-8e56-5553e61fb5d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f00fbb53a5c8f91e5347fe462d1411ba", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I would like to request art of my favorite vtuber. Her name is Rurumi Yumemi and she is a childish and menhera undertaker who likes teeth.\n\nPlease give her a smug expression. I also would like for you to draw one of her mascots. They are the two black and white ghosts shaped like teeth as shown in the first reference. Feel free to choose which one you want to draw. I would like for Rurumi to be grabbing the ghost by one of their wings.\n\nShe might want to repost or use the artwork for things like thumbnails and stream schedules, if that's ok. She typically provides credit.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/RurumiYumemi/status/1537499049980440576", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@siona0625/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1971667, "client_id": 2018010, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/93064d1c/uploads/origins/4ea44aa8-19d3-4b3e-a111-9298bb1c5925?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36885db4d1b5c217001d94cde62b3ab4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/93064d1c/uploads/origins/4ea44aa8-19d3-4b3e-a111-9298bb1c5925?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5f77bade2a0a2ec1cce0eb8b5461f137", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I like the OC drawing very much.\nShiona, could you please draw it again? I don't care what kind of clothes you draw.\nPlease enjoy ! ! ♥\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/V6kGyrw", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@siona0625/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1971667, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c20aa56c/uploads/origins/3d825aeb-38cb-426e-a137-e52d55815f64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2d84b12990b46dcf523855799a1b342", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c20aa56c/uploads/origins/3d825aeb-38cb-426e-a137-e52d55815f64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dacaea998db9be21db9b80ac975cfa35", "src_set": ""}, "body": "hello siona0625-san! i like your art so much!!! i really like how you draw your eyes, especially the eyelashes, and your colouring style!\n\ni wanted to request a drawing of my character please! she is very small and like a baby, she has white eyelashes and round eyebrows!\n\nthank you for considering!! 🥹🙆🏻‍♀️🙏🏼💞\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/13681470.milk/15573967.refs--/62164201", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@siona0625/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1971667, "client_id": 241853, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fb6accf1/uploads/origins/d5dc0e0a-0781-47d6-8fe6-75e3b9d58803?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e40799860ef1b7a12fe5be92ea4a9bdf", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fb6accf1/uploads/origins/d5dc0e0a-0781-47d6-8fe6-75e3b9d58803?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=994ca4e6674c63adff77cddb1a6ee24c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "hello! your art is gorgeous and i'd love to see my character drawn by you! reference: https://imgur.com/a/zR0aEUf she has two outfits, a dress and a magical girl outfit, you can decide which one you want to draw! thank you so much ♥", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@siona0625/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1971667, "client_id": 2018010, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7176b48f/uploads/origins/067671ff-c658-4ffe-b320-7822dcd364ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0682969bc81fc0282f7c9d4de4b8e2c9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7176b48f/uploads/origins/067671ff-c658-4ffe-b320-7822dcd364ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3ea6567dbb5067cb93e7b707a7d2865b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "汐那さんの絵がとてもとても好きです。ピーク、私のOCを描いてください。\n彼女は耳の聞こえない吸血鬼の猫娘。\n好きなように描いてください !  ! ♥\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/V6kGyrw", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 141, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "八朔つき", "screen_name": "starlet_moon", "avatar_url": "https://pbs